.TH batten-forge-poll 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-forge\-poll \- Read forge events from the first available declared source and run each through intake
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten forge poll\fR [\fB\-\-every\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read forge events from the first available declared source and run each through intake
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-every\fR \fI<every>\fR
Poll every this many seconds, registered with `task` as forge\-poll
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
